our deeds. The further you go into the forest, the more <span class=\"bb_strike\">firewood</span> there is. You will encounter a talking bush, a drunken stone, a psychologist fish, and many others. What secrets does the mysterious winter forest hold, once a witness to brutal violence, leaving its marks on the pristine canvas of winter?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707040/extras/0d37c2aaded87f3608cbd8c76bb7988b.poster.avif?t=1754592279\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707040/extras/0d37c2aaded87f3608cbd8c76bb7988b.webm?t=1754592279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707040/extras/0d37c2aaded87f3608cbd8c76bb7988b.mp4?t=1754592279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This place is filled with a dark atmosphere of confusion and anxiety..</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
